---
// Galen — by ARX Systems · full single-file marketing site. Returns the Galen
// front-office product to arxsystems.org, replacing the prior holding page.
// Authored as one self-contained document.
//
// Rendered verbatim by Astro:
//   <style is:inline>   CSS stays inline and verbatim — not bundled to an
//                       external /_astro/*.css file — so the page ships as one
//                       self-contained document and styles nodes inserted at
//                       runtime (validation errors, the success state).
//   <script is:inline>  keeps setPrice() and the intake handler as globals,
//                       which the inline onclick="setPrice(...)" attrs require.
//
// The intake form in #contact posts { type:'galen', ... } to POST /api/contact
// — the Resend-backed endpoint carried over from the previous site
// (server/routes/contact.js). Every "Book an intake" CTA scrolls to that form.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Galen — by ARX Systems</title>
<meta name="description" content="Galen is an AI receptionist for specialty physician practices — every call answered, booked, and routed, around the clock, in English and Spanish.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Galen — by ARX Systems">
<meta property="og:description" content="An AI front office for specialty practices. Every call answered, booked, and routed — around the clock, in English and Spanish.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#1A1A17">
<link rel="icon" href="/arx-mark.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&family=Inter:wght@400;450;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style is:inline>
  :root{
    --paper:#F4F2EC;
    --paper-2:#EBE8DE;
    --ink:#1A1A17;
    --ink-soft:#3D3D38;
    --ink-faint:#8A8A80;
    --teal:#0E6B6B;
    --teal-deep:#0A4F4F;
    --clay:#C0693E;
    --clay-soft:#D98A5E;
    --line:#D8D4C7;
    --white:#FCFBF7;
    --sans:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;
    --serif:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;
    --mono:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:var(--sans);
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px}
  @media(max-width:640px){.wrap{padding:0 20px}}

  /* eyebrow / kicker */
  .kicker{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--teal);
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;
  }
  .kicker::before{content:"";width:22px;height:1px;background:var(--clay)}

  h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.015em}
  h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6.2vw,68px)}
  h2{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px)}
  h3{font-size:22px;font-weight:600}
  em{font-style:italic;color:var(--clay)}
  .lead{font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,20px);color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:56ch;line-height:1.55}

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  nav{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
    background:rgba(244,242,236,.82);
    backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:66px}
  .brand{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:21px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .brand small{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-faint);font-weight:450;margin-left:4px}
  .brand .dot{color:var(--teal)}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:30px;align-items:center}
  .nav-links a{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft);text-decoration:none;transition:color .15s}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--teal)}
  @media(max-width:760px){.nav-links a:not(.nav-cta){display:none}}

  .btn{
    font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;
    padding:11px 20px;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none;
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;cursor:pointer;
    transition:transform .12s, background .15s, box-shadow .15s;border:0;
  }
  .btn-primary{background:var(--teal);color:var(--white)}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--teal-deep);transform:translateY(-1px)}
  .btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--teal);color:var(--teal)}

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{padding:78px 0 56px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:54px;align-items:center}
  @media(max-width:900px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:38px}}
  .hero h1{margin:20px 0 22px;max-width:14ch}
  .hero .lead{margin-bottom:32px}
  .herobtns{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .hero-note{margin-top:22px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-faint);letter-spacing:.03em}

  /* ECG panel — the signature */
  .ecg-panel{
    background:var(--ink);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:26px 24px 22px;
    box-shadow:0 24px 60px -28px rgba(14,107,107,.5);
    position:relative;
  }
  .ecg-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}
  .ecg-tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6FD4C8}
  .ecg-live{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:#C9C6BC}
  .ecg-live::before{content:"";width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#43D6A0;box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(67,214,160,.6);animation:pulse 1.8s infinite}
  @keyframes pulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(67,214,160,.5)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(67,214,160,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(67,214,160,0)}}
  .ecg-wave{width:100%;height:104px;display:block}
  .ecg-wave path{fill:none;stroke:#43D6A0;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;
    stroke-dasharray:1600;stroke-dashoffset:1600;animation:draw 3.4s ease-out forwards}
  @keyframes draw{to{stroke-dashoffset:0}}
  .console{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #2C2C28;padding-top:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px}
  .bubble{max-width:82%;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4}
  .bubble.in{background:#26262230;border:1px solid #33332E;color:#D8D5CB;align-self:flex-start;border-bottom-left-radius:3px}
  .bubble.out{background:#0E6B6B;color:#EAF6F4;align-self:flex-end;border-bottom-right-radius:3px}
  .bubble small{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;opacity:.6;margin-bottom:3px;letter-spacing:.08em}

  /* ---------- SECTION SHELL ---------- */
  section{padding:76px 0}
  .sec-alt{background:var(--paper-2)}
  .sec-dark{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
  .sec-head{max-width:60ch;margin-bottom:44px}
  .sec-head h2{margin:16px 0 14px}

  /* ---------- MISSED CALL COST ---------- */
  .cost-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}
  @media(max-width:840px){.cost-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px}}
  .cost-viz{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:30px}
  .cost-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
  .cost-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .cost-label{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .cost-num{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:30px;color:var(--clay);font-weight:500}
  .cost-num.teal{color:var(--teal)}
  .cost-foot{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:18px;letter-spacing:.02em}

  /* ---------- STEPS ---------- */
  .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:28px}
  @media(max-width:840px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}}
  .step{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:28px 26px;position:relative}
  .step .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--teal);letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:16px}
  .step h3{margin-bottom:9px}
  .step p{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft)}

  /* ---------- SERVICES ---------- */
  .svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px}
  @media(max-width:760px){.svc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .svc{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:28px;transition:border-color .2s, transform .2s}
  .svc:hover{border-color:var(--teal);transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .svc .tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--clay);display:block;margin-bottom:10px}
  .svc h3{margin-bottom:9px}
  .svc p{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft)}

  /* ---------- REFERENCE DEPLOYMENT ---------- */
  .proof{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
  .proof .pk{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6FD4C8;margin-bottom:22px}
  .proof blockquote{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(24px,3.4vw,34px);line-height:1.32;font-weight:400;font-style:italic}
  .proof .placeholder{color:var(--clay-soft);border:1px dashed #4A4A44;border-radius:10px;padding:22px;font-family:var(--sans);font-style:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5}
  .proof .by{margin-top:24px;font-size:14px;color:#B7B4AA;font-family:var(--mono);letter-spacing:.02em}

  /* ---------- PRICING ---------- */
  .price-card{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);border-radius:18px;padding:44px;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;box-shadow:0 30px 70px -34px rgba(14,107,107,.55)}
  .price-card .kicker{color:#6FD4C8}
  .price-card .kicker::before{background:var(--clay-soft)}
  .price-rows{margin:26px 0;border-top:1px solid #2C2C28}
  .price-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #2C2C28}
  .price-line .l{font-size:15px;color:#C9C6BC}
  .price-line .v{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:26px}
  .price-line .v small{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:#8A8A80;display:block;text-align:right;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .price-note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:#8A8A80;line-height:1.6;margin-top:6px;letter-spacing:.01em}
  .price-toggle{display:flex;gap:0;max-width:340px;margin:0 auto 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--white)}
  .price-toggle button{flex:1;padding:11px 14px;background:none;border:0;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-faint);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s}
  .price-toggle button.active{background:var(--teal);color:var(--white)}
  .toggle-note{text-align:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-bottom:26px;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .price-card .btn{width:100%;justify-content:center}

  /* ---------- FAQ ---------- */
  .faq{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}
  .qa{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .qa button{width:100%;text-align:left;background:none;border:0;padding:22px 0;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px}
  .qa .ai{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:20px;color:var(--teal);transition:transform .2s}
  .qa.open .ai{transform:rotate(45deg)}
  .qa .ans{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .28s ease}
  .qa .ans p{padding:0 0 22px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:64ch}

  /* ---------- END CTA ---------- */
  .endcta{text-align:center}
  .endcta h2{max-width:16ch;margin:16px auto 16px}
  .endcta .lead{margin:0 auto 30px;text-align:center}
  .endcta .herobtns{justify-content:center}

  /* ---------- INTAKE FORM ---------- */
  .intake-form{max-width:620px;margin:38px auto 0;text-align:left}
  .if-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}
  @media(max-width:600px){.if-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}}
  .if-field{margin-bottom:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .if-field label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B7B4AA;margin-bottom:8px}
  .if-field label .opt{text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--ink-faint)}
  .if-field input,.if-field select,.if-field textarea{
    font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--white);border:1px solid #33332E;border-radius:8px;
    padding:12px 14px;width:100%;transition:border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s;
  }
  .if-field textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:78px}
  .if-field input:focus,.if-field select:focus,.if-field textarea:focus{
    outline:none;border-color:var(--teal);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(14,107,107,.28);
  }
  .if-field.error input,.if-field.error select,.if-field.error textarea{border-color:var(--clay)}
  .if-field .err{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--clay-soft);margin-top:6px;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .if-submit{margin-top:6px}
  .intake-form .btn{width:100%;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;padding:14px 20px}
  .if-note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:14px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.6}
  .if-success{text-align:center;padding:26px 0}
  .if-success .ic{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(67,214,160,.14);border:1px solid #43D6A0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}
  .if-success h3{color:var(--paper);margin-bottom:8px}
  .if-success p{color:#B7B4AA;font-size:15px;max-width:46ch;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.55}

  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  footer{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:44px 0}
  .foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px}
  .foot .fb{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:20px;font-weight:600}
  .foot .fm{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:#8A8A80;margin-top:4px;letter-spacing:.04em}
  .foot .fl{display:flex;gap:26px}
  .foot .fl a{color:#B7B4AA;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none}
  .foot .fl a:hover{color:#6FD4C8}

  .flag{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--clay);border:1px solid var(--clay);border-radius:4px;padding:2px 7px;margin-left:8px;vertical-align:middle}

  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .ecg-wave path{animation:none;stroke-dashoffset:0}
    .ecg-live::before{animation:none}
    *{scroll-behavior:auto}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="wrap nav-in">
    <div class="brand">Galen<span class="dot">·</span><small>by ARX Systems</small></div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary nav-cta">Book intake</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">AI front office · specialty practices</div>
      <h1>The call your front desk <em>missed</em> just got answered.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Galen is an AI receptionist built for specialty physician practices. Every call picked up, booked, and routed — around the clock, in English and Spanish — running in a privacy-first, zero-retention mode built for HIPAA compliance.</p>
      <div class="herobtns">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book an intake call</a>
        <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-note">Reference deployment: a working Miami cardiology practice.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="ecg-panel">
      <div class="ecg-head">
        <span class="ecg-tag">Live call · line 1</span>
        <span class="ecg-live">answering</span>
      </div>
      <svg class="ecg-wave" viewBox="0 0 880 104" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path id="ecgPath"></path>
      </svg>
      <div class="console">
        <div class="bubble in"><small>CALLER</small>Hi, I need to reschedule my stress test for next week.</div>
        <div class="bubble out"><small>GALEN</small>Of course. I have Tuesday at 10:15 or Wednesday at 2:30 with Dr. Cespedes — which works better?</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- MISSED CALL COST -->
<section id="cost">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cost-grid">
      <div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom:0">
        <div class="kicker">The quiet leak</div>
        <h2>An unanswered phone is a patient who booked <em>somewhere else</em>.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Specialty practices lose bookings not to bad care but to voicemail. Every missed call is a new-patient lifetime value walking out the door — silently, every day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cost-viz">
        <div class="cost-row">
          <span class="cost-label">Calls a busy front desk misses / day</span>
          <span class="cost-num">18–30</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cost-row">
          <span class="cost-label">Share of callers who won't leave a voicemail</span>
          <span class="cost-num">~80%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cost-row">
          <span class="cost-label">Calls Galen answers</span>
          <span class="cost-num teal">100%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="cost-foot">// illustrative industry ranges — replace with reference-deployment figures once measured</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section id="how" class="sec-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="kicker">How it works</div>
      <h2>Layered onto the number you already have.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Nothing gets ripped out. Galen sits in front of your existing line and answers what used to go unanswered.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n">STEP 01</div>
        <h3>It answers</h3>
        <p>Every inbound call is picked up on the first ring, day or night, in English or Spanish — no hold music, no voicemail.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n">STEP 02</div>
        <h3>It books</h3>
        <p>New appointments, reschedules, and cancellations are handled and written straight to your scheduling system.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n">STEP 03</div>
        <h3>It routes</h3>
        <p>Clinical questions, emergencies, anything needing a human — passed to your team with the context already captured. It never guesses on something that matters.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="kicker">The engagement</div>
      <h2>Set up, maintained, and answered for — by one operator.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Not software you log into. A productized service run for you by someone who knows your practice.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <div class="svc">
        <span class="tag">The receptionist</span>
        <h3>Galen answers</h3>
        <p>Every call picked up, booked, rescheduled, and routed — around the clock, in two languages, with zero retention of patient data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
        <span class="tag">The storefront</span>
        <h3>A site that earns trust</h3>
        <p>A fast, credible practice website designed to turn a curious visitor into a booked patient — wired straight into Galen.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
        <span class="tag">The signal</span>
        <h3>Found where patients look</h3>
        <p>When someone asks an AI assistant or Google for a specialist in your city, your practice is the answer that surfaces.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
        <span class="tag">The identity</span>
        <h3>One coherent brand</h3>
        <p>A unified look and voice across the phone, the website, and every patient touchpoint — so the practice feels as serious as the care.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- REFERENCE DEPLOYMENT -->
<section class="sec-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="proof">
      <div class="pk">The reference deployment</div>
      <blockquote>&ldquo;Galen has solved my most major problem&#8202;&mdash;&#8202;the phone.&rdquo;</blockquote>
      <div class="by">Dr. Edgardo M. Cespedes, MD · Board-certified cardiologist, Miami · Co-developer &amp; first deployment</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PRICING -->
<section id="pricing" class="sec-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head" style="text-align:center;margin:0 auto 32px">
      <div class="kicker" style="justify-content:center">Pricing</div>
      <h2>One setup. One flat monthly. Everything included.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="price-toggle">
      <button id="tgStructure" class="active" onclick="setPrice('structure')">Structure only</button>
      <button id="tgNumbers" onclick="setPrice('numbers')">Show figures</button>
    </div>
    <p class="toggle-note" id="toggleNote">Recommended for a warm-intro sale — frames the model, quotes the number in the room.</p>

